hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"933","We were told by Bundar, Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Durqi, Yahya bin Hakim, and Ahmad bin Abdah. They said: Yahya told us, and he is the son of Saeed, Abu Hazra told us, and he is Yaqoub bin Mujahid. Abdullah bin Muhammad, who is the son of Abi Bakr Al-Siddiq, told us: We were at Aisha, food was brought, and Al-Qasim stood up to pray. Aisha said: I heard the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, say: “A prayer should not be performed in the presence of food, and he is not defended by the evil ones.”"
